   339	        // return data, so a misconfigured (or self-destructed) allowlisted target
   340	        // would no-op rather than swap. Defense-in-depth alongside the off-chain
   341	        // preflight code-existence check: fail closed before the call is made.
   342	        if (swapRouter.code.length == 0) revert CallTargetHasNoCode();
