     8	/// @notice Shared take-size scaling math for keeper taker contracts.
     9	/// @dev Ajna's take() may clamp the collateral actually purchased below the
    10	///      requested maxAmount on debt-constrained auctions. Keepers quote their
    11	///      output floor for the full planned size, so takers pro-rate that floor
    12	///      to the collateral Ajna actually sent. Internal functions are inlined
    13	///      by the compiler, so using this library does not change call semantics.
